ected presets, with deterministic variant names and tag-preserving deferral.\n\n## Changes\n\n### Preset Selection\n\n- **The title selects the target's presets.**\n  Complete comma-separated names apply above default, while headings and labels supply presentation.\n- **The guide specifies explicit compilation.**\n  One `--entry` and optional `--tags` carry the same selection through direct and deferred compilation.\n\n### Bundle Identity\n\n- **Each effective selection has one dispatched bundle.**\n  Scheduling, parallel sets, cycles and candidate validation share the document, fragment and matched-preset identity.\n- **Variant filenames have a precise recipe.**\n  Canonical UTF-8 JSON names supply the SHA-256 qualifier; filename collisions refuse publication.\n\n## References\n\n- **R1.** [W00 task #663](https://github.com/m2ux/prosiform/pull/663) — the design contract and its scoped validation.\n- **R2.** [W00 delivery evidence](https://github.com/m2ux/prosiform/blob/engineering/artifacts/planning/2026-11-06-662-i10-e07-w00-the-design-states-explicit/validation.md) — the immutable candidate pin, clause review and current-pin check limits.\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-11-06T09:20:42Z","updated_at":"2026-11-06T09:20:42Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"ccf0f45441e5034b1d12cf8e5e7b062a9bccb3f1","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"m2ux:i10/e07/engineering","ref":"i10/e07/engineering","repo":{"id":1423224592,"node_id":"R_kgDOVNSvEA","name":"prosiform","full_name":"m2ux/prosiform","owner":{"login":"m2ux","id":176900785,"node_id":"U_kgDOCotKsQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176900785?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux","html_url":"https://github.com/m2ux","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux/following{/other_user}","gi